# Environment Variables Configuration

# Mapbox Token (Required)
# Get your free token at: https://account.mapbox.com/access-tokens/
# This token is used for map rendering and geocoding services
# Note: Both variable names are supported for compatibility
VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN=pk.your_mapbox_token_here_replace_with_real_token
VITE_MAPBOX_PUBLIC_TOKEN=pk.your_mapbox_token_here_replace_with_real_token
